---
/**
 * Eyebrow
 *
 * The small coloured label above a heading. A <p>, never a heading: making
 * it one would break the outline and demote the real heading. In
 * --color-link rather than the accent, because eyebrows sit on grey bands.
 * See docs/03-components.md §3.5.
 *
 * @example
 * <Eyebrow>Contact</Eyebrow>
 * <h1 class="text-title">Let's talk.</h1>
 */
---

<p class="text-eyebrow text-link">
  <slot />
</p>
